<description>&lt;p&gt;Malian forces freed 24 soldiers held by armed groups in the Kidal region and received Mi-24 and Mi-8 helicopters and an Il-76 transport, while three UN peacekeepers were killed in northern Mali. France is in contact with local authorities after an attack in Burkina Faso and has advised its citizens to avoid the area. Burkina Faso is targeting critics living abroad, and the rivalry between al-Qaeda and ISIS is intensifying across the Sahel. Nigeria is using US intelligence support to target militants, and a truck crash in Niger state killed 14 people. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE1hWE5DbjJPb1V6d3lCWFEyaGNmd1lHUS1MVlVnajFYaDlLcHVleGplbnN0OThqZFR4OThJUjR4OVctdVRwQmpOa19qWFlhQ1k4SHhKTk14T1RGSjRmTlVLNVllMUg2aExRSERnSXZJand5UWpLeHgxSVN4Zzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;APAnews - Agence de Presse Africaine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQTThUVzc5X1k1Q2FHVEFlUDJhVE12X0hrMElpTVhEV0U2bjJtWjRlcm82amwydWNMOFBvZkxVRWdlYVIzSEtvSHFHbFpfM2JueGxTblhkdHFjek90MGx1MWVwTTVpaTVkSFVBbWhYX2ZqdnlEMnNhN05paFQ4clBwWXdfZDF2dm8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOcjk3UTVaWWhrQVd5MVNDem5DRWVEOFJhV3BybVAxVGlUd040X3JDbmhfSG0xX1RTZHRoV2k3Y0lwMzRSQUJ2RmRKQ00tM2U0cGNpWllIakNkOEtIckt3bUF2TXRfQ1hzaTlNX2hmb0ZLRXdDNlUyLXgyaGF0bnhNdFJiaWY4eUgtMXY3SUtlQmVpbGdDX1dRUw?oc=5&quot;&gt;TheCable&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE5rSDRnVk5nRmN6dnFtQ01CQWdwcnRBUS1oa1UtTzNrOEFYTFhqdUIyZmlTZTFxdjlaOERINlJXS0JyaEdfUXRWdkdOX3NnbWdVSmY5WGFpUlNGQUk?oc=5&quot;&gt;allAfrica.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://new